'''Season twenty-five''' of ''[[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)|Dancing with the Stars]]'' premiered on September 18, 2017, on the [[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] network.<ref name="Premiere Date">{{Cite news|url=http://www.thefutoncritic.com/news/2017/07/24/abc-announces-fall-series-premiere-dates-for-2017-18-season-626010/20170724abc02/|title=ABC Announces Fall Series Premiere Dates for 2017-18 Season|date=July 24, 2017|work=The Futon Critic|access-date=August 29, 2017}}</ref>

On November 21, 2017, actor and singer [[Jordan Fisher]] and [[Lindsay Arnold]] were crowned the champions, while violinist [[Lindsey Stirling]] and [[Mark Ballas]] finished in second place, and actor [[Frankie Muniz]] and [[Witney Carson]] finished in third.

==Cast==
===Couples===
This season featured thirteen celebrity contestants. ''[[Good Morning America]]'' announced the professional dancers who would be competing in the upcoming season on August 27, 2017.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2017/08/24/dancing-stars-season-25-mark-ballas-more-pros-announced/597101001/|title='Dancing with the Stars' Season 25 pros announced: Mark Ballas, Mr. and Mrs. Chmerkovskiy|last=Metz|first=Brooke|date=August 24, 2017|work=USA TODAY|access-date=August 28, 2017|language=en|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170827140616/https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2017/08/24/dancing-stars-season-25-mark-ballas-more-pros-announced/597101001/|archive-date=August 27, 2017|url-status=live}}</ref> [[Alan Bersten]], a member of the troupe since season 20, was promoted to pro. [[Drew Scott]] was announced as the first celebrity competing for the season, partnered with [[Emma Slater]].<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|url=https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/property-brothers-star-drew-scott-1st-celebrity-revealed/story?id=49502791|title='Property Brothers' star to compete on 'Dancing With the Stars'|last=ABC News|date=August 30, 2017|website=ABC News|access-date=August 30, 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170830155846/https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/property-brothers-star-drew-scott-1st-celebrity-revealed/story?id=49502791|archive-date=August 30, 2017|url-status=live}}</ref> On September 6, the rest of the cast was revealed on ''Good Morning America''.<ref name=":1">{{cite web |last=Fernandez |first=Matt |date=September 6, 2017 |title='Dancing With the Stars' Announces Full Season 25 Cast |url=https://variety.com/2017/tv/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-25-cast-1202548190/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170910185330/http://variety.com/2017/tv/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-25-cast-1202548190/ |archive-date=September 10, 2017 |access-date=September 6, 2017 |website=variety.com}}</ref>

