===Hosts and judges===
[[Tom Bergeron]] and [[Erin Andrews]] returned as hosts, while [[Carrie Ann Inaba]], [[Len Goodman]], and [[Bruno Tonioli]] returned as judges.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |title=About Dancing with the Stars |website=abc.go.com |access-date=March 1, 2017 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180316040627/http://abc.go.com/shows/dancing-with-the-stars/about-the-show |archive-date=March 16, 2018 |url-status=live }}</ref> [[Julianne Hough]] did not return as a permanent judge this season, though she did return as a guest judge during the first night of the finals.<ref name="PeopleJudge">{{cite web |url=http://people.com/tv/dancing-with-the-stars-season-25-judges-julianne-hough-not-returning-exclusive/ |title=Dancing with the Stars Season 25 Judges Revealed: Find Out Who's Back — and Who's Not! |last=Gomez |first=Patrick |work=People |date=September 13, 2017 |access-date=September 13, 2017 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170914035226/http://people.com/tv/dancing-with-the-stars-season-25-judges-julianne-hough-not-returning-exclusive/ |archive-date=September 14, 2017 |url-status=live }}</ref> On October 23, singer [[Shania Twain]] joined the panel as a guest judge.<ref name="Oct23">{{cite web|url=https://www.broadwayworld.com/bwwtv/article/Scoop-DANCING-WITH-THE-STARS-on-ABC-Monday-October-23-2017-20171019|title=Scoop: DANCING WITH THE STARS on ABC - Monday, October 23, 2017|work=BroadwayWorld.com|date=October 19, 2017|access-date=October 23, 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171024043338/https://www.broadwayworld.com/bwwtv/article/Scoop-DANCING-WITH-THE-STARS-on-ABC-Monday-October-23-2017-20171019|archive-date=October 24, 2017|url-status=live}}</ref>

=== Dance troupe ===
The troupe consisted of former pros [[Sasha Farber]] and [[Jenna Johnson (dancer)|Jenna Johnson]], and prior troupe members Artur Adamski, [[Brandon Armstrong (dancer)|Brandon Armstrong]], [[Hayley Erbert]], and [[Britt Stewart]].<ref>{{cite web |last=Gomez |first=Patrick |date=August 28, 2017 |title=Find Out Which Former Pros are Returning to the ''Dancing with the Stars'' Troupe for Season 25 |url=http://people.com/tv/dancing-with-stars-season-25-troupe-revealed-exclusive/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170829034258/http://people.com/tv/dancing-with-stars-season-25-troupe-revealed-exclusive/ |archive-date=August 29, 2017 |access-date=August 28, 2017 |work=[[People (magazine)|People]]}}</ref>

